# Compiled output of vite.config.ts. tsconfig.node.json is a composite project,
# so it must emit; it now writes to node_modules/.tmp instead of next to the
# source. These entries are a backstop, because a stray vite.config.js SHADOWS
# vite.config.ts — Vite checks for .js before .ts — and silently wins.
vite.config.js
vite.config.d.ts
tsconfig.node.tsbuildinfo

